    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog",
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "I know what I said. No one could just watch from the sidelines. There could be no bystanders."
    },
    {
        "text": "And yet, I still wanted to escape from the war. From Babel, from W, and from Her Majesty..."
    },
    {
        "text": "So I ran."
    },
    {
        "text": "...What a hypocrite."
    },
    {
        "text": "Do I regret it? Maybe."
    },
    {
        "text": "But even if I stayed there, I wouldn't have been able to accomplish anything."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_barracks",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$mist_intro",
        "key": "$mist_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "5:58 A.M. \\ Light drizzle"
    },
    {
        "text": "Northernmost outskirts of Kazdel, mercenary camp at the edge of the warzone."
    },
    {
        "text": "A few months after leaving Babel..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_047",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This intel...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "C'mon, say something. You're normally pretty glib.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...What's there to talk about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you throwing a question back at me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "...This deadlock has been dragging on for ages. Do you think the scales will tip overnight?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "What the hell happened these last six months? Aren't things moving way too quickly...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We all know something went wrong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "But as to exactly where, nobody knows.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess I shouldn't say nobody.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her Majesty... and the people around her. That never should've happened to them. That's what we all think.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But right now... what about us? Will the same thing happen to us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Too soon. This war ended too quickly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Up until last month, we were still working our contract with Babel. Then, they went quiet. We stopped getting any news...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone knew which side we were on, and it's not like we were even ready to leave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "...If that's really the end of things, we have nowhere to run.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell the Messenger to start pulling contacts and see what intel we can dig up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe we'll... have to return to the real battlefield.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I also figured that day was coming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "We all knew it deep down, didn't we?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we really wanted to wash our hands of the whole thing, we wouldn't have agreed to work with them in the first place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "We could've left on our own, crossed Lake Valendan, and made a killing somewhere else\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ines, I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "It'd be even harder for us to pull out of there. Too easy to get lost in that warmth. We'd get drunk on it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe we should just abandon Babel and take our people away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You still have that same old problem. You're getting sentimental again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't tell you how long, but it feels like it's been ages since I've made a good decision that actually helped us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe we really don't belong on the battlefield anymore...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough of that. Which one of us is the Sarkaz here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is there a single other place on Terra, like even a wooden shed over our heads, that can handle a bunch of bloodstained Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't always blame yourself. We all share the burden.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "Also, looking back, I can say that you made the right decision to take in W.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's made a lot of money for us. And offed a lot of people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hope so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "W... Is she still alive?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think she'd die so easily.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She spent a decent amount of time with Her Majesty as well. Who knows, maybe she learned a thing or two.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "text": "We need to get a grasp quick of the situation in Kazdel right now. If we can find her again, things might get a little easier.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do we really need her to back us up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_052",
        "name2": "avg_npc_047",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...What a damn shame.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_battlefield",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014There you are. Ugh, you sure know how to run.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "crossfade": 2,
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You look dead inside. I heard what you've been up to lately, W.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, you should also know that you're the last one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right. As you can see, a lot of people died in this battle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "All you're doing at this point is running up the score.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "The way I see things, anyone who isn't dead yet has done a lot more than you ever have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you need another reminder?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "Theresa is dead. All of Kazdel, all of Terra will know that Kazdel has a new king.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that was just a decapitation strike. A lot of your core operators are still alive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like that commander of yours who never showed up again. They made the right call.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "His Majesty didn't completely annihilate you because he wants to put a stop to the chaos. Kazdel needs him to pave a new path forward\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014But what about you? Who are you to lecture anyone about right or wrong?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course you won't say it, but I know that's what you're thinking. And while you're thinking, you're trying to erase all those faces from your memory, one by one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "After all, you're just here to vent. Just a petty little mercenary, drowning in her worthless revenge.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't beat anyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I can definitely beat you, pretty easily too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Killing me doesn't prove anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "All you do is run your mouth. Are you trying to read my mind, or just getting some last words out before you die?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A bit of both. I won't deny it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ever since that\u2014 since I almost choked on the blood of my friends, I haven't been able to hold a weapon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've all bled. Splattered it across Babel's palace. What you've seen, I've seen so much more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "But since you found me, I guess my fate is sealed. Hah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
