        "yScaleTo": 1,
        "duration": 25,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "...Getting away from Kazdel, huh."
    },
    {
        "text": "W has changed a lot. She should have her own ideas now."
    },
    {
        "text": "I pushed Ines down this path too, but she's stronger than I expected."
    },
    {
        "text": "...As for me?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Occasionally, if you climb up somewhere high and look down, you can see the plumes of smoke rising from Kazdel."
    },
    {
        "text": "Kazdel."
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe I'm the one who wants to escape from this place the most."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
